+  # vakt: JIT kernels are compiled at run time with the Metal language
+  # version of the running OS (get_metal_version(): 4.0 on macOS 26), and
+  # is_nax_available() checks for macOS 26.2 and an M5-class GPU before any
+  # NAX path runs. So the NAX sources need neither a 26.2 deployment target
+  # nor a build-time Metal 4 (MLX_METAL_VERSION comes from the metal compiler
+  # at -mmacosx-version-min, i.e. 3.1 for a macOS 14 target). MLX 0.31 did
+  # not ask for either; requiring them drops the matmul units from every
+  # binary that still runs on macOS 14.
+  if(MACOS_SDK_VERSION VERSION_GREATER_EQUAL 26.2)
 
     make_jit_source(
       steel/gemm/gemm_nax kernels/steel/utils.h kernels/steel/gemm/nax.h
